{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）下午1時31分，警方接報，荃灣柴灣角街84-92號一幢工業大廈的單位起火。消防員到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，並於約23分鐘後將火救熄，事件中20人需要疏散，暫時無接獲受傷報告。</p><p>現場消息指，涉事工廈高層一個單位懷疑電器的電線短路起火，事件初步沒有可疑。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員開喉撲救。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181249475243413504842075.jpeg/MvC-SuYG8zu4T45HwbXSPTRL55bhsW-jLAxoqwkMaKs\"/><figcaption>消防員開喉撲救。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"約20人需要緊急疏散。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181249224403062784670251.jpeg/aAYFCRy8QRIIDy-o8z9BIHUlxDyAdaMsQ7wUEGa8FBA\"/><figcaption>約20人需要緊急疏散。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"約20人需要緊急疏散。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181249227263709184412835.jpeg/mh2RKrZaE4GjqcYzNeDOVUC-m5ML6YCUW93ORH7dzkQ\"/><figcaption>約20人需要緊急疏散。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員開喉撲救。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181249229977554944541078.jpeg/Zn3hY2lM3DXfFQuFLPndtxHq_bzt0ieeTDcMHmk3DB4\"/><figcaption>消防員開喉撲救。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員開喉撲救。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181249592923000832185620.jpeg/Gtnzvt1acw-aGMMd2q2VjJr3ynTONuDr4cc5zsTHOc4\"/><figcaption>消防員開喉撲救。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防接報到場。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181249236743229440713085.jpeg/5B7SKEhCA00wbvhXvhLn11S2uWBtt_Dgfl5q4FteauA\"/><figcaption>消防接報到場。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是順豐工業中心。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181249215897014272625784.jpeg/4AHcHgZNRRifmTshvGMzuF3TIkqjDL74Qkcn9mdHJ_Y\"/><figcaption>現場是順豐工業中心。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T06:58:30.472657+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}